{
"dur": 126.98,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 12.72,
"text": "Overnight, everything goes. Accounts frozen. Their names and mugshots all over the news. Abe says: I don't know you. You're already dead. Valentina's bill has arrived.",
"end": 12.995
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 12.995,
"vo_start": 13.27,
"vo_end": 26.19,
"text": "Then messages from Mattia's number: did you miss me? Bring my things to a rooftop bar and I'll help. Lucia goes with the statue. Waiting for her isn't Mattia. It's Giorgio Gallo.",
"end": 26.465
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 26.465,
"vo_start": 26.74,
"vo_end": 38.54,
"text": "He holds the statue and says it's two thousand years old, and that she stole it from him. Both of them are flown to his penthouse, where Mattia is alive and apologising. Nothing personal.",
"end": 38.815
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 38.815,
"vo_start": 39.09,
"vo_end": 59.635,
"text": "Gallo explains. Italian ships, Albanian product, a perfect partnership, until the feds seized everything. The drive has dirt on a senator, so he can trade it for his ships. But the Albanians will kill him over twenty tonnes he's lost. You two, he says, are my secret weapons. Then the door locks from outside.",
"end": 59.91
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 59.91,
"vo_start": 60.185,
"vo_end": 74.265,
"text": "Chapter five. Top of the World, Ma, a nod to a famous old gangster film, where the man who says it does not have a happy ending. Gallo's problem: the coast guard is holding his twenty tonnes on a base in Vice City.",
"end": 74.54
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 74.54,
"vo_start": 74.815,
"vo_end": 90.77,
"text": "And then, sitting in Gallo's office with his feet on the desk: Niko Bellic. The hero of GTA 4, the man who came to America on a cargo ship in 2008 looking for a new life. Greyer now, voiced by the same actor, and speaking for the people whose product rides Gallo's ships.",
"end": 91.045
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 91.045,
"vo_start": 91.32,
"vo_end": 107.92,
"text": "If I'm here, he tells Gallo, you really messed up. Then a line for the fans: I haven't killed anybody since 2012. In GTA 5's story, set in 2013, Lester mentions an Eastern European guy from Liberty City who went quiet. Rockstar never confirmed it was him. The dates fit.",
"end": 108.195
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 108.195,
"vo_start": 108.47,
"vo_end": 126.03,
"text": "Gallo gets one more chance, but the job doubles. Steal back the twenty tonnes, and blow up a rival's shipment at sea. They use a coast guard sniffer dog to find the rival containers, then lift the cargo out in a net under a military helicopter. Niko's verdict: I was beginning to like it down here.",
"end": 126.98
}
],
